    "intro_html":  "Jamaican jerk is a seasoning and a cooking method, and the seasoning is the part that travels. Allspice, thyme, cinnamon, nutmeg and heat go onto the chicken, then the whole thing cooks down over rice and peas made the island way, with coconut milk and kidney beans in the pot. It is the single richest bowl in this batch at \u003cstrong\u003e751 calories and 51 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e, and it costs about \u003cstrong\u003e$3.81\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). One pot, one lid, no side dishes to think about.",
